{"suttaId":"tha-ap282","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[8684,8702],"vripara":"38"},"segments":{"tha-ap282:0.3":"Taraṇīyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap282:1.1":"“Mahāpathamhi visame, setu kārāpito mayā;","tha-ap282:1.3":"Taraṇatthāya lokassa, pasanno sehi pāṇibhi.","tha-ap282:2.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, yo setu kārito mayā;","tha-ap282:2.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, setudānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap282:3.1":"“Pañcapaññāsito kappe, eko āsiṃ samogadho;","tha-ap282:3.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap282:4.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap282:5.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā taraṇīyo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap282:6.1":"Taraṇīyattherassāpadānaṃ dasamaṃ.","tha-ap282:6.2":"Suvaṇṇabibbohanavaggo aṭṭhavīsatimo.","tha-ap282:7.1":"Tassuddānaṃ –","tha-ap282:8.1":"Suvaṇṇaṃ tilamuṭṭhi ca, caṅkoṭabbhañjanañjalī;","tha-ap282:8.3":"Potthako citamāluvā, ekapuṇḍarī setunā;","tha-ap282:8.5":"Dvecattālīsa gāthāyo, gaṇitāyo vibhāvibhīti.","tha-ap282:9.1":"Ekādasamaṃ bhāṇavāraṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
